# Hyprland plugins installed (and enabled) by blitzinstall / blitzart-hyprpm-setup.
# Format: <git url> <plugin name as in the repo's hyprpm.toml>
# Derived from the active (non-commented) code of the user's hypr/ config:
#   hyprflow          hl.plugin.hyprflow.*, plugin.hyprflow = {...}            (modules/func/plugin-init.lua)
#   dynamic-cursors   plugin.dynamic_cursors = {...}                           (modules/func/plugin-init.lua)
#   hy3               "hy3" in the layout cycle                                (modules/func/layout-cycle.lua)
#   hyprfocus         plugin.hyprfocus = {...} + animation leaf "hyprfocusIn" (plugin-init.lua, core/animations.lua)
#                     comes from hyprwm/hyprland-plugins (hyprpm builds every plugin of that repo, enables only this one)
#   HyprWindowShade   requested explicitly (per-window shaders); the name is case-sensitive
https://github.com/sandwichfarm/hyprflow          hyprflow
https://github.com/VirtCode/hypr-dynamic-cursors  dynamic-cursors
https://github.com/outfoxxed/hy3                  hy3
https://github.com/hyprwm/hyprland-plugins       hyprfocus
https://github.com/ManofJELLO/HyprWindowShade     HyprWindowShade
# Present in the config only as commented-out experiments - add a line here to install them:
# https://github.com/sandwichfarm/hyprexpo        hyprexpo
